Node ID=38 Inquisition
Text=I think very highly of the Inquisition. In the past, it has done great things. I disagree with their view that only divine magic can be used for good, and they would likely say that the magic I wield is a hair's breadth away from demon-craft. Still, both sides respect the other, and the Old Pact still binds us.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
