Node ID=41 templar
Text=Although the Knights Templar are our old allies in the jihad against the darkness, our use of magic has put us at odds with the Inquisition. We respect the edicts of the Inquisition, so we wait outside the city for a meeting with the Knights Templar. We offer our scimitars and magic to help support our western allies.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=That sounds very noble and tolerant of you and your order.
