------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=400 relics explanation
Text=The holy relics are objects of great divine power, each possessing the power of creation. In the hands of the pious, they can bring about great things, though wicked hands can use their power to bring about terrible evil. For centuries, it has been the duty of both knight orders to keep the holy relics of the east and west safe.  
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
