Node ID=500 Return from Montaillou
Text=The tragic deaths of the monks at Montserrat saddens me. I fear that our enemy now possesses several of the holy relics. You must follow the trail of these assassins and recover the Sacred Lance. Travel north to Montaillou and find the one named Brother Michel. May the Prophet give us strength in these endeavors.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will go to Montaillou now.
Go to node ID=238 Leave for Montserrat

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Before I go, tell me about the Sacred Lance.
Go to node ID=500 Sacred Lance
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=500 Sacred Lance
Text=The Sacred Lance is an ancient relic, wielded by a Roman soldier who used it to pierce the body of Christ, drawing his blood and imbuing it with powers. It was one of the relics used by the evil one to invoke the Disjunction. It was hidden centuries ago, but we fear our enemies might have discovered its resting place.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will leave for Montserrat to recover the Lance. 
Go to node ID=238 Leave for Montserrat
